<section>
    <h2 class="page-heading">Usage</h2>
    <p>
        The following code example and result shows a button inside a section that has had its default padding removed, and then added with the utility
        so that the button sits 0.5rem from the left edge (inline-start) and 1rem from the top (block-start).
    </p>

    <CodeBox CodeBlock="@CssClassesSnippets.Padding_Code_Example" AriaLabel="Padding code example." />

    <div class="@Section.Base @Section.Bordered @Section.FixedRadius(UnitRadius.One) @Section.NoPadding @Padding.InlineStart(UnitSpace.Three) @Padding.BlockStart(UnitSpace.Five)">
        <button class="@Button.Base @Button.FixedRadius(UnitRadius.One)">A button inside a section</button>
    </div>
</section>

